\ VIDEO2.SEQ    Actual video output routine             F-PC native port

VARIABLE NOSETCUR       \ When this is on, VIDEO-TYPE doesn't bother to
                        \ adjust the cursor position for performance reasons
DECIMAL

\ VIDEO-TYPE writes the string at column #OUT, row #LINE with attribute
\ ATTRIB, clipped at the right edge (no wrap, no scroll), advances #OUT and
\ leaves the cursor after the string.
BUILTIN VIDEO-TYPE      ( string length -- )
